// the prior strategy waited for the free LM to naturally emit "<<" via
// UnconstrainedChunk, so it could easily terminate or wander without ever
// entering constrained generation. For SMILES, the answer should be produced
// inside a visible span, so this revision makes a structural change on the
// outside-span axis: it opens a constrained span immediately instead of waiting
// for observed entry.
// 
